# Photographic Studio By Bill
# Allowlist: this repository holds ONLY the software and the shared lens and camera profiles.
# Everything else is ignored by default: photos, raws, exports, PDFs, logs, reports, calibration data.
# To add a new kind of software file, add its extension to the list below.

# 1. Ignore every file...
*
# ...but still look inside folders, so the rules below can let files back in.
!*/

# 2. Let the repository's own housekeeping files in.
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.editorconfig
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.*
!NOTICE
!CHANGELOG
!Cargo.lock

# 3. Software and profile file types (text only; no picture or raw formats are on this list).

!*.py
!*.PY
!*.pyi
!*.PYI
!*.bat
!*.BAT
!*.cmd
!*.CMD
!*.ps1
!*.PS1
!*.sh
!*.SH
!*.js
!*.JS
!*.mjs
!*.MJS
!*.ts
!*.TS
!*.html
!*.HTML
!*.css
!*.CSS
!*.json
!*.JSON
!*.rs
!*.RS
!*.toml
!*.TOML
!*.c
!*.C
!*.h
!*.H
!*.cpp
!*.CPP
!*.hpp
!*.HPP
!*.cc
!*.CC
!*.cmake
!*.CMAKE
!*.md
!*.MD
!*.txt
!*.TXT
!*.ini
!*.INI
!*.cfg
!*.CFG
!*.yml
!*.YML
!*.yaml
!*.YAML
!*.xml
!*.XML
!*.csv
!*.CSV
!*.svg
!*.SVG
!*.ico
!*.ICO
!*.woff
!*.WOFF
!*.woff2
!*.WOFF2
!*.ttf
!*.TTF
!*.otf
!*.OTF

# Looks: the shared starter looks in profiles/looks (our own settings, CC BY-SA).
# Your own looks are saved in /settings/looks, which is never shared (section 4).
!*.psblook
!*.PSBLOOK

# App icons only: PNGs are allowed in assets/icons and nowhere else.
!/assets/icons/*.png

# Face and people models (Google MediaPipe, Apache 2.0, see models/*/NOTICE): in models/faces and models/people only.
!/models/faces/*.tflite
!/models/people/*.tflite

# 4. Folders that are never shared, even if a file inside has an allowed type.
/Voigtlander/
/Zeiss/
/high iso raw/
/calibration/
/private/
/logs/
/reports/
/outputs/
/build/
/dist/
/cache/
/settings/
/calibration_local/
/.pytest_cache/
*.partial
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.vscode/
.idea/

# 5. Private by design, wherever they turn up: sensor fingerprints, hot-pixel and dust maps, secrets.
*fingerprint*
*prnu*
*hotpixel*
*hot_pixel*
*hot-pixel*
*dustmap*
*dust_map*
*dust-map*
.env
*.env
*secret*
